cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research note and its supporting software using the title, credits, and version below."
type: software
title: "A logarithmic loss in binary prefix coverage for prime reciprocals"
authors:
  - family-names: "zslcz"
  - name: "6.2Astra (AI assistant)"
version: "0.1.0-draft"
abstract: "For every fixed real base greater than two, restricting denominators to primes reduces complete binary prefix coverage of their reciprocals by at least the base-beta logarithm of the shell index, up to an additive constant. The repository supplies a written proof, reproducible data, and a Lean verification of the arithmetic step."
keywords:
  - beta expansions
  - reciprocals of primes
  - Fourier decay
  - prime gaps
